ense PK battles up close on the big virtual screen for a comprehensively upgraded interactive experience.", "short_description": "Douyin VR Live is a next-generation VR user-facing streaming platform that is committed to bringing you an exhilarating and immersive interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "logozh.png", "id": "1439261319980082", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75441583_1439261323313415_6105103478412624436_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iF5eUYMY2L4Q7kNvwG3OEnG&_nc_oc=AdkiMwzsqQq-SGrUrxnnyvXHp-ATpQaLccoLBU3xeQ-s1XoTZTuLJvuVLCbysxRnGsk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvwVFhfz4J13w3VJQawRdXk1vLlWL8xzQRfO6a0Ti0_Nw&oe=69A2C65C"}, {"file_name": "2560 x 1440.png", "id": "1222877525073722", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982446_1222877528407055_8056433039736167714_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sN7YPfeMVGAQ7kNvwENiful&_nc_oc=AdkehUf2ih1BPjbzMUKGzM-8xqMnq0qKyb4VylYRqVA57gVHfBwfFDWbJlZLOFQISYE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftabU30ZEHx_bcFzilxr3yedG3tG8iVjqtyXMBQui8tHQ&oe=69A2F99C"}, {"file_name": "1440 x 1440.png", "id": "961925418233844", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036617_961925421567177_3841510894552774559_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FWfuElPJie4Q7kNvwFg8o7Y&_nc_oc=AdndhXkcAQUIawMWmoEVgLwjm1xSRUUZY8KTb2KU9uYT11xEYFVdInmwS3pxkGO5LxU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvrczihveN_Y94kpq848dH82J26rD118C0S07_1Uygc0A&oe=69A2D145"}, {"file_name": "1080X360.png", "id": "715848710371996", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974523_715848713705329_284747130245148719_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XFb8ghLHzLEQ7kNvwE4jAJw&_nc_oc=Adm6QTOLvvmK